  "Arzobispo de Australia y Filipinas": "Archbishop of Australia and the Philippines",
  "Presidente de la Comisión de Santos, Causas de Canonización y Reliquias": "President of the Commission for Saints, Causes of Canonization and Relics",
  "Arzobispo de New Jersey, Estados Unidos": "Archbishop of New Jersey, United States",
  "Presidente de la Comisión Episcopal de Asuntos Internacionales y Diplomáticos": "President of the Episcopal Commission for International and Diplomatic Affairs",
  "Obispo Auxiliar · Vicario del Estado Plurinacional de Bolivia": "Auxiliary Bishop · Vicar of the Plurinational State of Bolivia",
