  "«Por sus frutos los conoceréis» (Mateo 7,20). Estas son las instituciones que trabajan como brazos extendidos de nuestra Iglesia, bajo la guía del Santo Sínodo Mundial.": "«By their fruits you will know them» (Matthew 7:20). These are the institutions that work as the outstretched arms of our Church, under the guidance of the Holy World Synod.",
  "Obra comunitaria, educativa y pastoral: atención integral a familias vulnerables, adultos mayores y niñez en riesgo, a través de albergues y comedores.": "Community, educational and pastoral work: comprehensive care for vulnerable families, older adults and children at risk, through shelters and soup kitchens.",
